    {
      "id": 30702,
      "name": "McBehrer",
      "username": "McBehrer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-18T16:18:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To clarify, her power is worded wrong. It says “prevent the next 2 damage she would take,” when it SHOULD say “The next time wraith takes damage, prevent 2 of it.”</p>\n<p>This way it’s clear that it only happens the next time she takes damage.</p>\n<p>It’s also important to note that since it says prevent – not reduce – it DOES prevent irreducible damage. When Plague Rat, for instance, does his attack and is buffed to 3 damage, it only deals Wraith 1 damage, even though it’s 3 irreducible.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:04:39.261Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 5797,
      "topic_slug": "wraith-preventing-damage",
      "display_username": "McBehrer",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
