      "raw": "[quote=\"\"McBehrer\"\"]\n\nTo clarify, her power is worded wrong. It says \"prevent the next 2 damage she would take,\" when it SHOULD say \"The next time wraith takes damage, prevent 2 of it.\"\n\nThis way it's clear that it only happens the next time she takes damage. \n\nIt's also important to note that since it says prevent -- not reduce -- it DOES prevent irreducible damage. When Plague Rat, for instance, does his attack and is buffed to 3 damage, it only deals Wraith 1 damage, even though it's 3 irreducible.\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nIt's also worth noting that her power is cumulative and if you have activated it multiple times she prevents that amount and then goes away regardless off how much is left (i.e. Wraith has activated her Stealth 3 times for a total damage prevention of 6 and later she receives 5 damage, all of it would be prevented and her Stealth would be reduced to 0).",
